{"sha": "705e60e19f445a6761342145fb315efc010dfad1", "node_id": "C_kwDOAA1TcNoAKDcwNWU2MGUxOWY0NDVhNjc2MTM0MjE0NWZiMzE1ZWZjMDEwZGZhZDE", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Mark Story", "email": "mark@mark-story.com", "date": "2022-11-01T14:30:35Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-11-01T14:30:35Z"}, "message": "fix(hc) Fix typings of model annotations (#40779)\n\nWithout the generic typevar, annotations for model classes were all\r\n'type' causing warnings in both sentry and getsentry for functions that\r\nwant to typehint on a model class.\r\n\r\nUsing a TypeVar results in the class type being preserved by the\r\ndecorator.\r\n\r\nFixes HC-428", "tree": {"sha": "a215b309864ec18504df0412f908b62faa007f5e", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/trees/a215b309864ec18504df0412f908b62faa007f5e"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/commits/705e60e19f445a6761342145fb315efc010dfad1", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJjYS2LCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAWtwIAEz/7NLL2KghJnBVTtIboNYF\n9tZ4oFEN5Sq+pnplBv3Ggwp1++k8J9+6gG8KIoWE57NlSplANH80xuS5l3g3skeG\nKhbdajleX65vyobQ3b8tftFwzKNfK+Ig0ZSI5tcpT2qTHwj/jsla1C6FWsIzJ1aG\n9IQz1CKPoY6KwrrfsbxjjxnDY/TY/S1mvO6jCZk1QxPA6WB2YD6LxgWiEXYlYCWQ\nEMa42mrkigwGNSPW4A2qgo3LlkWpyDo4oxIn7y12Y/L7XPEKss0Y1PkuFNSnjjki\nmoI7zvLkYdrGjTNDLh1jdDV2pvtBQwRiBmR3HVBYDGIHANLKKrDz//Jdrak8F1Q=\n=KmtD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree a215b309864ec18504df0412f908b62faa007f5e\nparent f1cacc59da58c9ae6808a22be21e4e60dcfcb067\nauthor Mark Story <mark@mark-story.com> 1667313035 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1667313035 -0400\n\nfix(hc) Fix typings of model annotations (#40779)\n\nWithout the generic typevar, annotations for model classes were all\r\n'type' causing warnings in both sentry and getsentry for functions that\r\nwant to typehint on a model class.\r\n\r\nUsing a